{"ref":"BDB, מִחְיָה","hw":"מִחְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִחְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. preservation of life, sustenance</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:5\" href=\"/Genesis.45.5\">Gn 45:5</a> + 4 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחְיַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.10\">Lv 13:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.24\">24</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחְיָתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:10\" href=\"/Judges.17.10\">Ju 17:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>preservation of life</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:5\" href=\"/Genesis.45.5\">Gn 45:5</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.12\">2 Ch 14:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>sustenance</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:4\" href=\"/Judges.6.4\">Ju 6:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:10\" href=\"/Judges.17.10\">17:10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>reviving</em>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:8\" href=\"/Ezra.9.8\">Ezr 9:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:9\" href=\"/Ezra.9.9\">9</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>the quick</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּשָׂר) מִחְיַת</span> <em>the quick</em> (or raw spot) <em>of the flesh</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.10\">Lv 13:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.24\">24</a> (P).","next":"BDB, חִיאֵל²","prev":"BDB, חַיּוּת"}